</div>

</td>
<td class="ordw-c" width="303">
из <a class="ordw-tnved" href="/tnved/?tnved=97">группы 97</a>
</td>

</tr>
<tr class="ordw-r">
<td class="ordw-c" width="342">
<div class="ordw-justify">
